[h1]Flavorium Universalis v0.3.10 Hotfix[/h1]

[i]Compatible with EU5 1.3.* | Multiplayer synchronized[/i]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]New: French, German and Spanish localization[/h2]

The mod now ships French, German and Spanish text. All 4,686 strings the main mod adds are covered, including trait names and descriptions, event text and options, subject types, the Balance of Power panel and the Subject Relations Ledger. The Balance and UI Fixes submods are translated as well.

[list]
[*] [b]Coverage:[/b] every string the mod adds, in all three languages.
[*] [b]Machine translated:[/b] produced with a local language model and validated automatically, but not reviewed by a native speaker. Some phrasing will read stiffly.
[*] [b]English fallback:[/b] roughly fifty strings per language kept their English text, either because they are icon or variable markup with nothing to translate, or because the translation could not reproduce a game variable safely. Falling back was preferred over shipping a string that would display wrongly.
[*] [b]No gameplay changes:[/b] this release adds localization files only. English text is untouched.
[/list]

If a string reads badly or a name looks wrong in your language, note the localization key and the language and it can be corrected in a later update.
